服的，再 7 日以内向上一级申请复核。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["公安部 (2020). 公安机关办理刑事案件程序规定（公安部令第 159 号修正后，第一百七十一、一百七十八、一百七十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2020/content_5549884.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2020/content_5549884.htm"]},"；公安部 (2013/2019 修正). 公安机关办理行政案件程序规定（公安部令第 125 号、第 149 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2013/content_2321117.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2013/content_2321117.htm"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["定 C 的理由：「很多人把窗口后面的人当成一个角色、不当成上班的人」这个判断本身没有文献可引。能引的只有规则那一半：期限、文书和救济渠道都是明文的。本条引的数字全部来自第 8 节第 39 条（报警之后的流程）那两份公安部规章。按流程走管不了「对方态度差」，也不保证一定办成，改的只是你的预期和第一步动作。银行柜员、政务窗口也一样：他们操作留痕、要复核、出错要追责。所以该做的是留凭条、要回单、按渠道投诉，别凭「他会不会坑我」瞎猜。合法的优先级都写在明处，比如急诊按病情分级，不按先来后到（第 24 节第 7 条，急诊预检分诊）。想谢救过你的医生，就走感谢信和满意度评价，见第 24 节第 11 条。想「送点东西让人家多上点心」，对办案执法的人就是行贿罪，而且是明文从重的，见第 8 节第 40 条。遇到明显的区别对待，该投诉就投诉，别当成潜规则去模仿。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/03-18"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"情绪低落时先做性价比最高的几件事：动起来、晒太阳、按时睡、找人说、打 12356"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/03-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"别把「别人过得怎么样」当每日必读：给刷同龄人动态的应用设限或关掉"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-15"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把「事情肯定会更糟」这类念头当症状看，不当事实看"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一项跟踪了 20 年的双生子研究里，悲观程度每高一个档，同期死亡的概率高约 13%，死于心血管病的概率高约 20%。反过来，乐观得分高并没有带来相应的好处。所以…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-16"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["减少让你消耗的人际关系，学会拒绝不想接的请求"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一个消耗你的人造成的损失，比一个支持你的人带来的好处更大，也更一致。所以先做减法，再做加法。"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-17"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["生气时先离场，把对方当天气而不是当敌人"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["换个角度看刚发生的事，或者站到对方立场想一下，都能把情绪降下来，后一种更管用。只是不把情绪表现出来，也有一点效果；硬压住心里的感受、硬不去想那件事，都没用。惩罚…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-21"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["觉得「所有人都看见我出丑了」的时候，把这个估计除以二"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["穿尴尬的 T 恤进屋，以为将近一半人认得出衣服上印的是谁，实际不到四分之一。换成体面的 T 恤也一样高估。小组讨论完，人也以为自己说错的话别人记得更清楚。聊完天…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-22"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["把「别人要求我做到完美」当症状看，不当事实看"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["总觉得「周围的人要求我完美，做不到就会被否定」的人，更容易有自杀念头。「我自己要求自己完美」和自杀念头的关系弱得多，只有前一种的三分之一左右。把原本就有的念头扣…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/03-23"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["生气时别靠砸东西、打沙袋、跑一圈来发泄，先让身体慢下来"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["打沙袋、摔东西、去跑一圈，这类让身体更兴奋的发泄办法，整体上消不了气。慢呼吸、正念、冥想这类让身体静下来的办法，能明显压下怒气和想动手的劲。"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/03"},"children":["阅读整个主题：不要浪费精力 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21",